issue_context.body:
At the moment in scripts  the _source can't be synthesised when  synthetic source is enabled. 
This will be slow, but we should allow this to avoid breaking existing visualisations when migrating to tsdb.

```
PUT index1
{
    "mappings": {
        "properties": {
            "@timestamp": {
                "type": "date"
            },
            "field1": {
                "type": "keyword",
                "time_series_dimension": true
            },
            "field2": {
                "type": "keyword"
            }
        }
    },
    "settings": {
        "index": {
            "time_series": {
                "start_time": "2000-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
                "end_time": "2099-12-31T23:59:59.999Z"
            },
            "routing_path": [
                "field1"
            ],
            "mode": "time_series",
            "number_of_shards": "1"
        }
    }
}

POST /index1/_doc
{
    "@timestamp": "2000-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
    "field1": "1",
    "field2": "2"
}

GET index1/_search
{
    "runtime_mappings": {
        "field3": {
            "type": "keyword",
            "script": {
                "source": "emit(params._source.field1 + params._source.field2)"
            }
        }
    },
    "aggs": {
        "field3": {
            "terms": {
                "field": "field3"
            }
        }
    }
}
```

The last search request results into the following error:

```json
